    "sections": {
        "description": "The Solar Generator Theme is a modern, eco-friendly, and feature-rich solution designed for solar panel companies, renewable energy providers, solar EPC contractors, solar power installers, energy consultants, solar farms, clean energy startups, and sustainability-focused organizations. This theme offers a visually appealing, responsive, and highly customizable platform to showcase solar energy solutions, solar panel installation services, solar rooftop systems, off-grid solar projects, portable solar generators, solar lighting, solar water heaters, photovoltaic advancements, and solar-powered appliances. Ideal for residential, commercial, and industrial solar businesses, it highlights essential services like solar system design, solar battery storage, solar inverter integration, energy audits, net metering, green energy consulting, solar tax credits, solar financing options, and power purchase agreements (PPA). Built with a clean design, interactive service sections, and visually engaging layouts, it is optimized for SEO to rank in searches like “best solar panels,” “solar companies near me,” and “renewable energy solutions.” The theme integrates e-commerce functionality to sell solar products, energy-saving devices, solar accessories, and sustainable equipment with ease. It features advanced customization options, social media integration, translation readiness, secure coding, fast loading speeds, and mobile responsiveness for a seamless user experience across all devices. Compatible with WooCommerce and enhanced by the Solar Calculator plugin for instant energy savings estimates and lead generation, this theme empowers solar energy companies to create a professional, informative, and impactful digital presence that promotes clean energy, eco-conscious living, and a sustainable future."
    },
